The full local suite passes all gates: 0/200,000 valid structure-aware guesses, one exact shipping witness in \(2^{89}\), all four attacks at 0/8, 60/60 canonical-key invariance checks, and the doubled instance verifies. The bare multi-vendor oracle run is in progress at the easy rung; API latency, rather than local computation, is currently the long pole.
