+        f"Their IDs are 4n+5j through 4n+5j+4 (here 4n={4*n}). The gadget "
+        "segments are (c_j,c_j), (d_j,d_j), (p_j1,p_j2), (p_j2,p_j3), "
+        "and (p_j3,p_j1).",
